import ArithmeticTeichmullerSpaces.Act1Scene1.WeierstrassTranscendentalPointEvaluation
import ArithmeticTeichmullerSpaces.Act1Scene1.GenuineCoordinateNormalizationSurjective
import Mathlib.RingTheory.Localization.AtPrime.Basic

/-!
source-id: JT-SCENE1-BOUNDARY-PRODUCER-CONTRACTS-20261021
additional-source-ids: JT-SCENE1-GENUINE-DIVISION-POINT-EVALUATION
source: the original Weierstrass coordinate-ring evaluation, its injectivity
for a supplied transcendental point, and the existing coordinate-ring normality.
fidelity: identifies the image with the actual two-coordinate subalgebra and
transports existing integral closedness to it and each of its prime localizations.
The supplied point and its original coordinates are unchanged.
